stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NotCheckedIn
    NotCheckedIn --> CheckingIn : request check-in
    CheckingIn --> NotCheckedIn : invalid Session / Membership / Access
    CheckingIn --> NotCheckedIn : AttendancePolicy denied
    CheckingIn --> CheckedIn : create AttendanceSession
    CheckedIn --> CheckingOut : request check-out
    CheckingOut --> CheckedIn : invalid Session / Membership / Access
    CheckingOut --> CheckedIn : AttendancePolicy denied
    CheckingOut --> CheckedOut : close AttendanceSession
    CheckedOut --> [*]
    note right of CheckedIn
        Identity.Session authenticates User.
        AttendanceSession records attendance.
        TimeEntry and Timesheet belong to Timekeeping.
    end note
